      "instance_name": "stage_performance",
      "label": "musical performance on stage",
      "description": "A black-and-white scene depicting three women performing music on a stage under spotlights. One woman on the left wears a beret and claps enthusiastically, another in the center plays a saxophone, and a third on the right sings into a vintage microphone while wearing a hat. The scene conveys a lively, nostalgic musical performance.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
